WEBVTT

01:33.320 --> 01:35.591
(Adapted from the web novel "Waiting for You in a City")

01:35.651 --> 01:37.951
(Fireworks of My Heart)

01:38.020 --> 01:40.921
(Episode 18)

01:42.960 --> 01:43.830
Congratulations.

01:48.800 --> 01:49.531
Xu Qin.

01:50.201 --> 01:51.300
Are you jealous?

01:52.940 --> 01:54.100
That's how I am.

01:54.770 --> 01:56.210
It's not the first day you met me.

02:07.850 --> 02:08.621
Xu Qin.

02:10.251 --> 02:11.621
You've already made your decision.

02:12.121 --> 02:13.460
I respect your decision.

02:15.261 --> 02:16.530
But after these few days,

02:16.930 --> 02:18.161
has this ever occurred to you?

02:26.141 --> 02:27.541
Maybe one day,

02:28.340 --> 02:29.971
I'll let you go completely.

02:31.911 --> 02:33.580
Fall in love with another woman,

02:34.210 --> 02:35.210
get married,

02:36.280 --> 02:37.250
and have kids.

03:06.810 --> 03:08.280
Da Peng, you're here too.

03:08.680 --> 03:09.580
Ms. Nan.

03:39.340 --> 03:40.080
Da Peng.

03:41.851 --> 03:43.451
Is this glove...

03:43.580 --> 03:44.951
yours?

03:45.280 --> 03:46.280
Yes.

03:46.981 --> 03:47.650
Right.

03:47.721 --> 03:48.421
They're mine.

03:48.620 --> 03:50.291
You wash your gloves...

03:50.490 --> 03:51.861
quite casually.

03:53.120 --> 03:54.960
My standard for washing gloves...

03:55.060 --> 03:55.960
is for them not to stink.

04:02.471 --> 04:04.330
Guys at your age...

04:04.400 --> 04:05.300
are lazy.

04:05.541 --> 04:06.201
Look.

04:06.370 --> 04:07.541
Put some detergent...

04:07.701 --> 04:08.770
and rub them.

04:09.041 --> 04:10.171
Isn't it already clean?

04:13.780 --> 04:14.541
Ms. Nan.

04:15.351 --> 04:16.351
As a doctor,

04:16.411 --> 04:17.150
are you...

04:17.210 --> 04:18.180
a bit of a mysophobe?

04:18.981 --> 04:20.120
This is called basic hygiene,

04:20.180 --> 04:21.250
not being a mysophobe.

04:21.590 --> 04:23.120
You make me speechless.

04:24.591 --> 04:25.390
Da Peng.

04:25.591 --> 04:26.461
You joined the firehouse

04:26.521 --> 04:27.861
at a young age, didn't you?

04:28.560 --> 04:30.060
I was in the army before.

04:30.130 --> 04:31.091
When I was 18.

04:31.760 --> 04:32.500
After I got discharged,

04:32.560 --> 04:33.531
there was a reform here,

04:33.601 --> 04:34.971
so I became a firefighter.

04:35.731 --> 04:37.101
Does it feel any different?

04:38.000 --> 04:38.940
It's almost the same.

04:39.000 --> 04:40.101
I'm still serving the people.

04:41.810 --> 04:43.041
It's done. Here you go.

04:44.640 --> 04:45.510
It's really clean.

04:46.140 --> 04:46.981
Thank you, Ms. Nan.

04:47.111 --> 04:48.351
Okay, I'll get going.

04:55.890 --> 04:59.961
(Kindness, Professionalism, Innovation)

05:09.971 --> 05:11.101
(Inpatient Department)

05:11.171 --> 05:12.000
Uncle.

05:12.070 --> 05:13.671
Thank you for saving us.

05:13.841 --> 05:15.411
This candy is for you.

05:28.851 --> 05:30.221
Thank you too.

05:56.611 --> 05:58.211
People are so complicated.

05:59.481 --> 06:01.151
If only everyone could be...

06:01.221 --> 06:02.521
as simple as you.

06:03.120 --> 06:04.620
You're mocking me again, aren't you?

06:04.921 --> 06:06.060
It's a compliment.

06:06.521 --> 06:07.490
I don't believe you.

06:07.560 --> 06:08.221
Dr. Yang.

06:08.291 --> 06:09.190
Submit the report for me.

06:09.260 --> 06:10.430
I'm going back to the fire station.

06:18.341 --> 06:19.271
Dr. Xu.

06:20.541 --> 06:21.240
Hello.

06:22.310 --> 06:24.711
Did Chen Yu ever tell you...

06:25.240 --> 06:26.940
why he saved people back then?

06:27.581 --> 06:28.550
I don't understand.

06:28.851 --> 06:30.010
Why would a bad guy like him...

06:30.081 --> 06:31.281
give up his chance to live...

06:31.351 --> 06:32.820
again and again?

06:33.151 --> 06:33.851
Are you...

06:34.250 --> 06:35.320
also his girlfriend?

06:35.651 --> 06:36.521
This time,

06:36.651 --> 06:37.921
I initially asked him out...

06:38.661 --> 06:39.361
with the intention...

06:39.421 --> 06:41.091
of accompanying the other victims...

06:41.221 --> 06:42.231
in slapping him...

06:42.560 --> 06:44.130
and sending him to the police.

06:45.361 --> 06:47.331
Then this happened.

06:48.870 --> 06:49.901
It has been two years.

06:51.531 --> 06:53.471
I was so true to him.

06:56.111 --> 06:57.711
Don't they say this online nowadays?

06:58.240 --> 06:59.440
Scam everything,

06:59.581 --> 07:00.880
except for money.

07:02.880 --> 07:03.680
That's not true for me.

07:04.950 --> 07:06.180
Scam everything,

07:06.380 --> 07:07.421
except for love.

07:08.050 --> 07:09.791
I hate him to the core now.

07:10.721 --> 07:12.560
But I personally saw...

07:12.620 --> 07:13.461
that he helped...

07:13.521 --> 07:14.190
the people around him escape first...

07:14.260 --> 07:15.591
again and again,

07:15.661 --> 07:16.430
including me.

07:16.731 --> 07:17.461
It's as if...

07:17.661 --> 07:18.831
there are two personalities, inside his body at the same time.

07:18.901 --> 07:20.401
One good and one bad.

07:21.771 --> 07:22.601
I guess...

07:23.200 --> 07:24.401
heroism and nastiness...

07:24.870 --> 07:26.041
can coexist...

07:26.101 --> 07:27.000
in a person at the same time.

07:31.541 --> 07:32.740
Thank you, Dr. Xu.

07:37.050 --> 07:37.880
I'll get going.

07:38.151 --> 07:39.581
I have to go to the police station to give my statement.

08:16.990 --> 08:18.661
What happened to Chen Yu afterward?

08:19.320 --> 08:20.120
I heard that...

08:20.559 --> 08:21.588
after he was arrested,

08:22.361 --> 08:23.990
he confessed the truth...

08:24.015 --> 08:25.015
about his crimes.

08:25.700 --> 08:26.430
The Public Safety Bureau...

08:26.500 --> 08:27.731
was lenient with him...

08:27.800 --> 08:28.930
for his heroic actions.

08:29.000 --> 08:30.130
He must have changed...

08:30.200 --> 08:31.101
due to everyone's good comments.

08:31.570 --> 08:33.300
He returned all the money he swindled.

08:33.901 --> 08:34.570
Those girls...

08:34.640 --> 08:36.370
also wrote him a letter of understanding.

08:37.140 --> 08:38.041
The netizens also said...

08:38.111 --> 08:39.640
that the benevolence of those girls...

08:41.380 --> 08:42.811
saved Chen Yu.

08:43.650 --> 08:44.910
Everyone's kindness...

08:44.981 --> 08:45.981
is indeed powerful.

09:06.640 --> 09:07.540
Thank you, Instructor,

09:07.740 --> 09:09.240
for cooperating with us in the second Fire Scene Inspection.

09:09.571 --> 09:10.510
It's part of my job.

09:10.711 --> 09:12.510
Putting out fire and preventing it go together.

09:13.681 --> 09:14.341
Let's go.

09:15.551 --> 09:16.211
Let's go.

09:23.920 --> 09:25.821
The scene has been checked...

09:25.890 --> 09:26.920
and disinfected.

09:32.701 --> 09:34.201
There are more combustible materials in here.

09:34.701 --> 09:36.170
The burn marks are serious.

09:37.370 --> 09:38.101
The foam on top...

09:38.170 --> 09:40.071
was from when we extinguished the fire.

09:41.170 --> 09:42.611
That's the point of origin of the fire, right?

09:53.020 --> 09:54.221
Are there other possibilities?

09:55.451 --> 09:56.221
Let's take a look.

10:19.111 --> 10:19.880
Everyone.

10:19.941 --> 10:21.211
Thank you for your hard work.

10:22.410 --> 10:24.280
Thank you.

10:25.181 --> 10:25.851
Ma'am.

10:25.920 --> 10:27.620
The... The roof just went through a fire.

10:27.821 --> 10:28.481
It's very dangerous.

10:28.650 --> 10:30.020
Why... Why don't I accompany you?

10:33.321 --> 10:34.520
It's white and deformed.

10:35.331 --> 10:36.160
The finish is peeling off.

10:37.160 --> 10:38.290
The circuit deteriorated.

10:38.361 --> 10:39.231
The circuit shorted.

10:39.301 --> 10:39.961
When the fire broke out,

10:40.030 --> 10:41.331
it went over there.

10:42.670 --> 10:43.370
Mr. Zhao.

10:47.841 --> 10:48.770
Be careful.

11:02.451 --> 11:03.191
Ma'am.

11:03.520 --> 11:04.851
Let's not waste time here.

11:04.920 --> 11:05.591
All right?

11:05.890 --> 11:06.660
My warehouse is so big.

11:06.721 --> 11:07.620
There's so much trash.

11:07.721 --> 11:08.890
You're searching one by one.

11:08.961 --> 11:10.530
How long will it take?

11:11.630 --> 11:12.461
The smell of oil.

11:13.861 --> 11:14.701
Spill fire.

11:16.170 --> 11:17.331
You guys arrived at the scene...

11:17.400 --> 11:18.400
at 9:55pm.

11:20.841 --> 11:21.640
By then,

11:22.111 --> 11:23.240
the fire was already huge.

11:23.811 --> 11:24.910
This is the other possibility.

11:30.611 --> 11:31.811
Let's check somewhere else.

11:46.030 --> 11:46.861
Multiple points of origin.

11:56.211 --> 11:56.910
Ma'am.

11:58.311 --> 11:59.311
Can you issue...

11:59.380 --> 12:00.640
the accident certificate as soon as possible?

12:01.081 --> 12:02.551
It's hard to run a business.

12:02.611 --> 12:04.010
- Please help us. - Don't worry.

12:04.410 --> 12:05.851
We'll take it back for examination first.

12:06.120 --> 12:06.780
Who are you?

12:06.851 --> 12:07.821
How did you break in?

12:13.721 --> 12:14.691
Is it that hard...

12:14.760 --> 12:15.660
to issue an accident certificate?

12:16.461 --> 12:17.961
If the Fire Department hadn't arrived late,

12:18.361 --> 12:19.400
would the goods in my warehouse...

12:19.461 --> 12:20.601
burn down so quickly?

12:20.931 --> 12:22.370
Are you trying to shirk responsibility?

12:22.530 --> 12:23.530
Our fire station...

12:23.601 --> 12:25.770
has a report and dispatch record.

12:27.341 --> 12:28.341
They're full of excuses.

12:29.140 --> 12:29.811
Fine.

12:29.870 --> 12:30.640
I won't count on you...

12:30.711 --> 12:31.571
for the accident certificate.

12:31.640 --> 12:32.811
I'll hire a third party.

12:33.181 --> 12:34.510
It's more objective and fair.

12:34.581 --> 12:35.351
You may go.

12:35.880 --> 12:36.750
The people can leave,

12:36.811 --> 12:37.481
but the stuff...

12:37.951 --> 12:38.650
stays.

12:39.951 --> 12:41.821
This place has been sealed off by the Fire Department.

12:41.920 --> 12:42.721
Please cooperate...

12:42.920 --> 12:43.890
with our work.

12:44.020 --> 12:44.790
Nice.

12:46.260 --> 12:47.561
It's so hard...

12:47.620 --> 12:48.321
to ask you to do something.

12:49.731 --> 12:50.490
That's right.

12:54.361 --> 12:55.731
Just speak, don't get physical.

12:55.801 --> 12:56.801
Don't go too far.

12:59.900 --> 13:01.301
I'll get physical here.

13:01.441 --> 13:02.571
What can you do to me?

13:06.211 --> 13:07.341
Don't get physical.

13:07.410 --> 13:09.150
Don't fight back, Da Peng!

13:09.611 --> 13:10.611
We can't fight back.

13:11.611 --> 13:12.380
Secure the evidence.

13:12.451 --> 13:13.221
Go!

13:20.990 --> 13:22.231
Article 277 of the Criminal Code states that...

13:22.290 --> 13:23.191
using violence and threats...

13:23.260 --> 13:25.030
in interfering with the job of a state staff...

13:25.091 --> 13:26.831
is punishable by imprisonment of not more than three years.

13:33.941 --> 13:34.601
Chief?

13:36.540 --> 13:37.311
Protect Officer Li.

13:43.081 --> 13:43.951
Go.

13:44.581 --> 13:45.280
Go!

14:18.481 --> 14:19.681
Go after him. Don't let him get away!

14:20.181 --> 14:20.851
Don't...

14:24.520 --> 14:25.821
- Freeze. - Don't move!

14:32.231 --> 14:33.160
- Get up. - Freeze.

14:33.231 --> 14:33.961
Don't move. Get up.

14:34.961 --> 14:35.630
Officer.

14:36.201 --> 14:36.870
- Let's go. - Come on.

14:36.931 --> 14:37.601
Thank you.

14:38.770 --> 14:39.601
Are you all right, Yang Chi?

14:42.211 --> 14:42.870
I...

14:42.941 --> 14:43.640
I'm fine.

14:45.010 --> 14:45.841
I'm okay.

14:45.981 --> 14:46.740
It's just a scratch.

14:46.811 --> 14:47.611
Are you hurt?

14:47.941 --> 14:48.640
I'm fine.

14:57.221 --> 14:57.890
Tell me.

14:57.951 --> 14:58.721
There was a spill fire.

14:59.458 --> 15:00.758
- Was there an accelerant? - Yes.

15:00.861 --> 15:01.660
Gas or diesel?

15:01.890 --> 15:02.561
Gas.

15:02.760 --> 15:03.819
And there are multiple points of origin.

15:07.160 --> 15:08.301
It's arson.

15:11.471 --> 15:12.240
Sirs.

15:12.301 --> 15:12.971
Sirs, ma'am.

15:13.170 --> 15:14.101
I'm sorry.

15:14.170 --> 15:15.770
It's a misunderstanding.

15:16.040 --> 15:17.540
Great people don't harbor grievances for past mistakes.

15:18.140 --> 15:19.140
Don't hold grudges...

15:19.380 --> 15:20.611
against civilians like us.

15:20.941 --> 15:22.551
We'll let the test results speak for itself.

15:23.481 --> 15:24.150
What test?

15:24.211 --> 15:25.211
It was an accident.

15:25.280 --> 15:25.951
A test?

15:26.020 --> 15:26.750
Save your explanation...

15:27.051 --> 15:28.280
for the police.

15:29.221 --> 15:29.890
Instructor.

15:30.390 --> 15:31.650
How many years is the sentence for arson?

15:31.821 --> 15:33.290
Over three years, less than ten years.

15:34.660 --> 15:35.731
You bought insurance, did you?

15:35.961 --> 15:36.961
You want to commit insurance fraud?

15:37.061 --> 15:37.961
No.

15:38.361 --> 15:39.061
Sirs, ma'am.

15:40.160 --> 15:41.461
I know the Bureau's leaders...

15:41.530 --> 15:42.370
quite well.

15:42.900 --> 15:44.801
Let's do this for their sake.

15:44.971 --> 15:47.240
We don't want people...

15:47.841 --> 15:48.701
to be embarrassed.

15:50.611 --> 15:51.571
Complain if you want.

15:52.581 --> 15:53.981
Shilitai Fire and Rescue Station,

15:54.780 --> 15:55.581
Song Yan.

16:01.250 --> 16:02.051
Jiang Yu.

16:22.007 --> 16:22.676
Don't move.

16:26.410 --> 16:27.211
Stop right there.

16:28.481 --> 16:29.981
Don't let me see you again.

16:34.620 --> 16:35.721
Are you intentionally messing with me?

16:36.620 --> 16:37.551
I'm disinfecting.

16:37.620 --> 16:38.790
You can't even stand this much pain.

16:38.851 --> 16:40.091
You're intentionally messing with me, right?

16:40.221 --> 16:40.990
Stay still!

16:41.561 --> 16:42.331
Officer.

16:42.431 --> 16:43.091
I want to file a complaint.

16:43.431 --> 16:44.091
She mistreated me.

16:45.160 --> 16:46.461
Tell me your name if you have the guts.

16:46.731 --> 16:47.400
Come on.

16:48.301 --> 16:49.571
Central Hospital Emergency Department,

16:49.801 --> 16:50.601
Xu Qin.

16:51.301 --> 16:51.971
Get up.

16:54.140 --> 16:55.040
Just wait.

16:58.240 --> 16:59.010
Song Yan.

16:59.581 --> 17:00.481
Dr. Xu...

17:00.540 --> 17:01.341
is quite similar to you.

17:03.681 --> 17:04.410
Yang...

17:05.581 --> 17:06.451
Yang...

17:07.181 --> 17:07.851
You're calling me?

17:08.880 --> 17:09.721
Yes.

17:09.790 --> 17:10.821
Mr. Yang.

17:14.420 --> 17:15.690
"Mr. Yang?"

17:15.761 --> 17:16.890
Just call me Yang Chi.

17:17.361 --> 17:19.831
No, your hand is injured.

17:21.061 --> 17:22.301
It's just a scratch. It happens all the time.

17:22.370 --> 17:23.031
I'm fine.

17:23.601 --> 17:24.630
Take a seat.

17:24.700 --> 17:25.531
I'll treat it for you.

17:26.741 --> 17:27.741
Thank you then.

17:35.480 --> 17:36.150
It's fine.

17:36.210 --> 17:37.081
It doesn't hurt.

17:37.581 --> 17:38.380
It doesn't hurt.

17:40.021 --> 17:41.380
If the Instructor didn't stop me,

17:41.920 --> 17:43.251
I would have beaten them up.

17:43.991 --> 17:45.291
Okay, stop talking about it.

17:46.991 --> 17:47.960
All right, raise your head.

17:51.831 --> 17:53.930
Jiang Yi, I'm fine.

17:54.130 --> 17:55.061
Why don't you leave?

17:55.130 --> 17:56.370
I'm fine too. I'll stay with you.

17:57.130 --> 17:58.170
I'm really fine.

17:58.601 --> 18:00.341
Why don't you go check on the others?

18:06.241 --> 18:07.011
Well...

18:07.241 --> 18:07.910
Dr. Li.

18:08.011 --> 18:08.841
Please take care of him.

18:09.011 --> 18:09.680
Sure.

18:12.880 --> 18:13.851
It hurts a little here.

18:14.150 --> 18:15.120
All right.

18:15.821 --> 18:17.491
Didn't it hurt when you were fighting?

18:17.720 --> 18:19.061
I didn't fight back.

18:19.521 --> 18:20.991
I feel sorry for you.

18:21.690 --> 18:22.460
Da Peng.

18:23.061 --> 18:23.761
Instructor.

18:25.091 --> 18:26.261
You took two punches for me.

18:27.130 --> 18:28.301
You were aggrieved.

18:29.870 --> 18:30.730
It's okay, Instructor.

18:31.331 --> 18:32.700
I didn't let you guys fight back.

18:33.700 --> 18:34.771
You don't blame me, right?

18:37.041 --> 18:37.841
No.

18:38.341 --> 18:39.710
This is our principle.

18:39.781 --> 18:40.910
We can't have any rifts and conflicts...

18:40.980 --> 18:42.950
with the public.

18:46.851 --> 18:47.821
After she's done with your mouth,

18:47.880 --> 18:48.781
- rinse your mouth. - Above.

18:49.051 --> 18:49.851
Okay.

18:49.991 --> 18:51.220
You're so delicate.

18:52.591 --> 18:53.390
Do you feel better?

18:53.460 --> 18:54.420
Much better.

18:55.361 --> 18:56.460
Rinse your mouth. Hurry.

18:56.890 --> 18:57.831
I know.

19:10.811 --> 19:12.311
Don't cry.

19:13.710 --> 19:14.541
I'm fine.

19:17.410 --> 19:19.420
It's normal for firefighters to get hurt.

19:19.781 --> 19:20.980
There's really no need to cry.

19:23.690 --> 19:24.521
I'm really fine.

19:25.420 --> 19:26.620
This is...

19:29.091 --> 19:30.660
This is how I am.

19:35.561 --> 19:37.101
Did I scare you just now?

19:39.001 --> 19:39.700
No.

19:52.251 --> 19:53.220
Don't do that next time.

19:54.720 --> 19:55.420
What?

19:56.390 --> 19:57.051
Don't provoke them.

19:57.620 --> 19:58.521
Don't act tough.

19:58.791 --> 19:59.620
Don't tell them who you are.

20:09.930 --> 20:10.801
Dr. Xu.

20:11.930 --> 20:13.071
We're going to pack up and go back.

20:14.501 --> 20:15.400
Done.

20:16.841 --> 20:17.571
Thank you, Chief.

20:17.640 --> 20:19.180
There's a recovery period.

20:19.241 --> 20:20.180
It's nothing.

20:21.741 --> 20:22.551
- Be careful. - Chief.

20:24.011 --> 20:24.680
It hurts.

20:27.980 --> 20:28.851
How are you...

20:29.190 --> 20:30.120
during this period of time?

20:31.021 --> 20:31.920
What do you mean?

20:31.991 --> 20:33.960
How's work?

20:34.021 --> 20:35.021
Do you think I'm asking you...

20:35.761 --> 20:36.761
how you're doing?

20:38.130 --> 20:38.890
To be honest,

20:39.501 --> 20:40.301
overqualified.

20:41.101 --> 20:41.861
Who?

20:41.960 --> 20:42.630
Me.

20:45.531 --> 20:46.970
I heard from Li Nan before...

20:47.400 --> 20:48.700
that you have...

20:48.801 --> 20:49.940
quite an attitude at work.

20:50.011 --> 20:51.170
This is how you are.

20:51.541 --> 20:52.781
You're quite confident.

20:53.541 --> 20:54.440
To be honest,

20:54.940 --> 20:56.111
this team won't last long.

20:56.180 --> 20:57.710
After working together during this period of time,

20:57.781 --> 20:58.551
I think...

20:59.081 --> 21:00.321
it's not a long-term solution...

21:00.380 --> 21:01.521
for the hospital's doctors...

21:01.851 --> 21:03.051
to directly participate in fire rescue.

21:04.021 --> 21:04.950
We can do more...

21:05.021 --> 21:06.321
in the hospital.

21:07.220 --> 21:07.960
Fortunately,

21:08.690 --> 21:09.660
the experimental team...

21:09.730 --> 21:10.861
is almost done.

21:11.160 --> 21:12.561
I think we're doing quite well.

21:12.700 --> 21:13.430
Look.

21:13.761 --> 21:14.730
Teamwork.

21:15.261 --> 21:16.170
Quick reflexes.

21:16.801 --> 21:17.870
Rescue and efficiency.

21:18.271 --> 21:19.900
It's just that there's a problem...

21:19.970 --> 21:21.541
with this system's longevity.

21:21.771 --> 21:23.241
But I think the problem can be solved.

21:23.511 --> 21:24.210
Listen to me.

21:24.640 --> 21:25.710
If you want to have doctors,

21:26.210 --> 21:27.741
you can recruit people...

21:28.210 --> 21:29.751
and give assignments or contracts.

21:30.450 --> 21:31.511
But you know that having hospital staff...

21:31.581 --> 21:33.021
with you long-term...

21:33.420 --> 21:34.650
isn't realistic.

21:36.190 --> 21:36.890
You didn't see...

21:37.690 --> 21:39.420
how Da Peng looked at Dr. Li earlier.

21:39.591 --> 21:40.261
Let me tell you...

21:40.321 --> 21:41.920
When a nurse...

21:43.361 --> 21:44.761
dresses your wound...

21:45.130 --> 21:47.101
and she actually had tears in her eyes,

21:47.630 --> 21:48.400
is she concerned about you?

21:49.130 --> 21:50.430
You're in trouble too.

21:50.501 --> 21:51.170
Who is it?

21:51.930 --> 21:52.741
Let me see.

21:52.801 --> 21:53.541
- Who? - Don't.

21:53.601 --> 21:54.670
All right.

21:56.611 --> 21:57.511
You must be mistaken.

21:57.741 --> 21:58.410
That's impossible.

21:58.470 --> 21:59.781
I have great eyesight.

22:00.511 --> 22:02.011
It's just a small injury.

22:02.081 --> 22:02.880
What's there to be concerned about?

22:02.950 --> 22:04.051
You must be mistaken.

22:04.380 --> 22:05.150
How is that possible?

22:05.210 --> 22:06.220
If she's not concerned about me,

22:06.450 --> 22:07.220
she likes me.

22:08.650 --> 22:09.720
The one who dressed...

22:09.791 --> 22:10.650
your wound,

22:10.720 --> 22:11.551
Xu Xi.

22:11.620 --> 22:12.291
Xu Xi.

22:12.491 --> 22:13.660
- Don't. - Xu Xi.

22:13.720 --> 22:14.861
You're so annoying.

22:14.920 --> 22:16.430
All right, I'll tell you.

22:16.690 --> 22:17.361
Seriously.

22:17.430 --> 22:18.230
You two are great.

22:27.900 --> 22:28.970
Why are you so diligently...

22:29.041 --> 22:30.541
cooperating with us?

22:30.940 --> 22:32.271
It's an occupational habit, okay?

22:32.341 --> 22:33.180
I'm dedicated to my job.

22:33.241 --> 22:34.311
All right.

22:34.380 --> 22:35.541
You're dedicated to your job.

22:36.410 --> 22:37.910
I heard from my mom...

22:37.980 --> 22:38.680
that your mom...

22:38.751 --> 22:39.980
wants to introduce you...

22:40.051 --> 22:41.180
to the Dong family's son, right?

22:41.321 --> 22:42.120
A blind date, right?

22:42.180 --> 22:43.291
You know about that too?

22:43.890 --> 22:44.551
Look.

22:44.620 --> 22:45.821
But I don't think you two...

22:46.620 --> 22:47.620
are a good match.

22:48.120 --> 22:48.791
Song Yan.

22:49.660 --> 22:50.761
Have you noticed...

22:51.331 --> 22:52.761
that the Instructor seems to know...

22:52.831 --> 22:53.900
Dr. Xu quite well?

22:55.200 --> 22:55.900
- I didn't notice. - If you do better,

22:56.370 --> 22:57.900
my mom can be a matchmaker for us.

22:58.730 --> 23:00.101
But to her,

23:00.170 --> 23:01.400
you're just a jobless person now.

23:01.741 --> 23:02.571
Don't say that.

23:02.640 --> 23:03.970
I'll resign immediately...

23:04.410 --> 23:05.841
and do something big.

23:06.140 --> 23:07.011
Will you come with me?

23:07.081 --> 23:07.741
Sure.

23:07.811 --> 23:08.581
Thank you then...

23:08.640 --> 23:09.811
for saving me from misery.

23:10.081 --> 23:10.980
Don't say that.

23:11.551 --> 23:12.751
This is the first time it occurred to me that you...

23:12.851 --> 23:15.051
What are the Instructor and Dr. Xu talking about?

23:15.120 --> 23:15.920
They're so into it.

23:15.991 --> 23:17.021
- Right. - They're cheerful and lively.

23:18.420 --> 23:19.690
Don't be fooled by...

23:21.561 --> 23:22.291
Got it.

23:22.361 --> 23:23.031
Song Yan.

23:23.331 --> 23:24.160
I'll take care of it for you.

23:27.561 --> 23:28.331
You and...

23:28.400 --> 23:29.331
Instructor.

23:29.601 --> 23:30.370
Let's go.

23:31.801 --> 23:32.670
He's calling you.

23:32.900 --> 23:34.170
I'll take the vehicle at the back.

23:36.311 --> 23:37.370
Think about it.

23:41.041 --> 23:41.741
What do you think, Song Yan?

23:41.940 --> 23:42.950
If this happens in the future,

23:43.011 --> 23:44.011
just look at me.

23:44.251 --> 23:45.111
We'll get it.

23:45.180 --> 23:46.021
Get lost.

23:48.720 --> 23:49.491
I'd like to lodge a complaint.

23:50.521 --> 23:51.220
He said...

23:51.620 --> 23:52.920
he's from the Shilitai Fire Department.

23:54.061 --> 23:54.861
Who is it?

23:56.130 --> 23:56.791
Sit down.

24:00.630 --> 24:01.960
They have a very bad attitude.

24:02.501 --> 24:03.601
They were brutal.

24:04.601 --> 24:05.271
Yes.

24:13.680 --> 24:14.341
Drive.

24:14.940 --> 24:15.611
You...

24:32.630 --> 24:33.430
Reporting.

24:35.200 --> 24:35.861
Come in.

24:41.970 --> 24:44.511
(Branch Director Office)

24:48.640 --> 24:49.650
I handled everything.

24:49.851 --> 24:50.710
It has nothing to do with the Instructor.

24:50.781 --> 24:51.910
I got there first.

24:51.980 --> 24:52.920
He was there to back us up.

24:52.980 --> 24:53.851
I beat him up.

24:53.980 --> 24:54.720
Punish me.

24:54.851 --> 24:55.650
I failed to protect everyone.

24:55.720 --> 24:56.690
I'll take full responsibility.

25:00.091 --> 25:01.061
This is so hard.

25:01.821 --> 25:03.091
There's only one prize.

25:04.730 --> 25:06.061
Who should I give it to?

25:12.271 --> 25:13.341
Don't fight back.

25:13.900 --> 25:15.170
Don't talk back.

25:15.640 --> 25:18.571
That's the discipline in firefighting.

25:21.011 --> 25:22.980
When you wear this uniform,

25:23.980 --> 25:26.180
you're not representing yourself.

25:27.251 --> 25:28.620
It represents the image...

25:29.120 --> 25:31.220
of all firefighters.

25:31.521 --> 25:32.190
Right?

25:32.650 --> 25:33.890
I'm also responsible for this.

25:34.220 --> 25:35.220
They did it to protect me.

25:35.960 --> 25:37.361
But thanks to their support,

25:37.831 --> 25:38.730
we were able to find out...

25:38.831 --> 25:40.101
the real cause of the fire.

25:40.160 --> 25:41.700
Do you think I'm stupid?

25:44.101 --> 25:46.271
Someone complained to the headquarters today.

25:47.170 --> 25:48.140
I got reprimanded.

25:48.400 --> 25:49.741
But I feel good...

25:51.841 --> 25:53.241
about being reprimanded.

25:53.311 --> 25:53.980
Why?

25:54.581 --> 25:55.541
Because we found out...

25:55.611 --> 25:57.581
that someone set the fire on purpose.

25:57.980 --> 25:59.210
He must be punished severely.

25:59.781 --> 26:01.450
Even if he has great connections,

26:01.880 --> 26:03.321
this matter is non-negotiable.

26:05.591 --> 26:07.420
That's why you two...

26:08.521 --> 26:09.220
did a good job on this.

26:13.831 --> 26:14.900
My son-in-law...

26:15.761 --> 26:16.970
gave me this can of tea...

26:17.730 --> 26:19.741
during Chinese New Year.

26:20.341 --> 26:21.400
There's only one can left.

26:23.170 --> 26:23.970
You two can share it.

26:24.041 --> 26:25.111
You keep it, Mr. Gao.

26:28.140 --> 26:28.940
Thank you, Mr. Gao.

26:30.281 --> 26:31.450
You're quite fast.

26:32.180 --> 26:33.450
You hit them, didn't you?

26:33.781 --> 26:34.650
That's not right.

26:35.220 --> 26:37.051
It's not right to hit people, okay?

26:38.390 --> 26:39.051
However,

26:39.120 --> 26:40.591
when a bad guy commits a crime,

26:40.920 --> 26:42.160
you must stick to your duty...

26:42.460 --> 26:43.430
and perform self-defense.

26:43.890 --> 26:44.561
Write a report.

26:44.831 --> 26:45.660
Explain the situation.

26:46.091 --> 26:46.761
As usual,

26:46.960 --> 26:47.761
three thousand words.

26:47.930 --> 26:49.001
Not a word less.

26:49.331 --> 26:50.170
As usual.

26:50.771 --> 26:51.470
- Instructor... - Wait.

26:51.531 --> 26:52.400
Write it yourself.

26:55.170 --> 26:55.970
Yes.

26:56.140 --> 26:56.811
Attention.

26:57.910 --> 26:59.111
Turn to the left.

27:00.380 --> 27:01.480
Forward march.

27:11.220 --> 27:12.450
Did I say...

27:13.091 --> 27:14.491
something wrong?

27:16.021 --> 27:16.861
No.

27:16.930 --> 27:18.630
Then why are you laughing?

27:18.960 --> 27:19.630
Who's laughing?

27:19.700 --> 27:20.501
Also,

27:20.561 --> 27:22.200
when I was educating them,

27:22.261 --> 27:22.930
why...

27:23.601 --> 27:24.730
did you interrupt?

27:26.571 --> 27:27.470
Who interrupted?

27:30.511 --> 27:31.311
Chief Song.

27:31.771 --> 27:32.640
Thank you.

27:33.440 --> 27:34.241
You're thanking me?

27:34.980 --> 27:35.841
What for?

27:36.581 --> 27:37.611
If it weren't for you,

27:38.650 --> 27:39.980
I'd be in the hospital now.

27:40.650 --> 27:41.851
How dare you say that?

27:42.420 --> 27:43.851
You're Shilitai's Instructor,

27:44.120 --> 27:45.251
and your shoe fell off.

27:45.521 --> 27:46.460
If you aren't embarrassed,

27:46.521 --> 27:47.491
I'm embarrassed.

27:47.561 --> 27:48.861
I can fight one-on-one.

27:49.061 --> 27:50.930
Fighting five people is a problem.

27:51.160 --> 27:51.861
Besides,

27:51.930 --> 27:53.761
my training has been paying off.

27:53.831 --> 27:55.061
You have to trust me.

27:55.400 --> 27:56.470
You want to thank me, right?

27:58.101 --> 27:59.001
- The report... - Three thousand words.

27:59.071 --> 28:00.001
Leave it to me.

28:00.501 --> 28:02.771
I'll make sure the words are meticulous.

28:02.841 --> 28:04.140
I'll recreate the scene.

28:05.341 --> 28:06.241
Not bad.

28:06.541 --> 28:07.611
You're quite sensible.

28:13.251 --> 28:14.581
I had a chat with Xu Qin.

28:15.021 --> 28:16.390
You two get along well.

28:16.821 --> 28:18.420
Anyone with half a brain...

28:18.851 --> 28:19.551
would see it that way.

28:19.620 --> 28:20.291
No.

28:20.791 --> 28:21.920
She was against this before.

28:22.160 --> 28:23.061
Look at her lately.

28:23.160 --> 28:24.331
She's on duty with us every day...

28:24.460 --> 28:25.430
with no complaints.

28:27.361 --> 28:28.331
Tell me.

28:29.670 --> 28:30.870
Does she...

28:31.331 --> 28:32.771
like someone...

28:32.970 --> 28:34.170
in our fire station?

28:37.370 --> 28:39.341
With your sharp eyes,

28:40.640 --> 28:41.710
do you think...

28:43.450 --> 28:44.680
she likes me?

28:48.150 --> 28:48.920
You?

28:49.081 --> 28:49.890
Yes.

28:50.190 --> 28:51.821
Didn't I tell you before?

28:52.021 --> 28:53.420
Our families are very close.

28:53.491 --> 28:55.420
We even had dinner together before.

28:55.761 --> 28:56.561
She wasn't that friendly.

28:56.630 --> 28:57.430
Look at her lately.

28:58.960 --> 28:59.700
Is she captivated...

28:59.761 --> 29:01.630
with my serious attitude...

29:02.361 --> 29:03.601
at work?

29:03.730 --> 29:05.001
Isn't this what they say online?

29:05.470 --> 29:07.341
A hardworking man...

29:07.571 --> 29:08.470
is the most charming.

29:09.601 --> 29:10.541
I want to throw up.

29:11.041 --> 29:12.541
Don't throw up yet.

29:14.041 --> 29:15.341
Aren't you two close?

29:15.541 --> 29:16.781
Let me ask you something.

29:16.851 --> 29:17.611
We're not close.

29:18.551 --> 29:19.650
Why are you asking about her?

29:20.450 --> 29:21.880
I'm a man.

29:21.950 --> 29:23.150
She's a girl.

29:23.220 --> 29:23.890
If she likes me,

29:23.950 --> 29:25.450
I have to pursue her.

29:27.660 --> 29:28.460
You're not aware...

29:28.521 --> 29:30.031
of the types of girls...

29:30.091 --> 29:32.031
my mom introduced me to.

29:32.430 --> 29:34.460
I like the cold and quiet type.

29:34.730 --> 29:35.400
The ones she introduced...

29:35.460 --> 29:36.970
are all cute,

29:37.271 --> 29:38.730
enthusiastic,

29:39.001 --> 29:40.470
proactive, and elegant.

29:41.140 --> 29:42.301
If she really likes me,

29:42.601 --> 29:43.611
I'll pursue her.

29:44.710 --> 29:45.970
She doesn't like you.

29:46.781 --> 29:47.581
She doesn't like me?

29:48.480 --> 29:49.410
Did she tell you?

29:49.480 --> 29:50.751
I don't need her to tell me.

29:51.650 --> 29:52.351
Also,

29:53.051 --> 29:54.480
how is she quiet and cold?

29:54.781 --> 29:56.420
How is she not cute and coquettish?

29:56.890 --> 29:57.690
Do you know her well?

29:57.821 --> 29:58.720
Cut the crap.

29:59.861 --> 30:00.821
Do you know her well?

30:00.890 --> 30:02.291
How do you know if she's cute or not?

30:02.420 --> 30:03.091
I...

30:06.531 --> 30:07.261
I know her better than you.

30:07.331 --> 30:08.261
- Do you like her? - Leave her alone.

30:08.331 --> 30:09.160
Do you like her?

30:09.230 --> 30:10.331
You like her, right?

30:10.400 --> 30:11.230
Do you like her?

30:11.301 --> 30:12.400
- Tell me. - Yes.

30:12.571 --> 30:13.301
I like her.

30:13.700 --> 30:15.970
I like her more than what you can see, think,

30:16.041 --> 30:17.011
or understand.

30:20.311 --> 30:21.341
You like her?

30:21.910 --> 30:22.581
For the first time...

30:22.811 --> 30:23.950
For the first time...

30:26.821 --> 30:28.281
I forced the truth out of you.

30:28.521 --> 30:31.021
I finally got you once.

30:37.561 --> 30:38.430
Today,

30:38.890 --> 30:40.130
don't let me see you again.

30:43.470 --> 30:44.170
Tonight,

30:44.470 --> 30:45.531
don't go back to the dorm.

30:47.400 --> 30:48.140
I'll go back.

30:49.440 --> 30:50.311
Do you like her?

30:50.370 --> 30:51.170
I won this time.

30:51.241 --> 30:52.210
This time, I won.

30:58.480 --> 30:59.781
I get angry just thinking about it.

31:00.021 --> 31:01.321
We're wearing these clothes...

31:01.380 --> 31:02.851
to serve the people.

31:03.091 --> 31:04.890
Why can't we fight back if we're being beaten up?

31:05.491 --> 31:06.591
It's so pathetic.

31:06.720 --> 31:07.561
The instructor protected us...

31:07.620 --> 31:08.660
and even got hit a few times.

31:08.821 --> 31:10.091
Who can we reason with?

31:11.630 --> 31:12.561
The Instructor is so nice.

31:13.361 --> 31:14.630
Although he's usually a bit naggy,

31:14.960 --> 31:15.630
but when there's trouble,

31:15.700 --> 31:16.361
he's really something.

31:16.601 --> 31:17.271
Stop it.

31:17.331 --> 31:18.501
When I think that the Instructor got the short end of the stick,

31:18.571 --> 31:20.140
I feel even worse.

31:20.470 --> 31:22.041
Why does he deserve this?

31:22.170 --> 31:22.940
That's right.

31:23.170 --> 31:23.870
It's okay.

31:23.940 --> 31:24.970
When I video-called my mom a few days ago,

31:25.041 --> 31:25.811
I even said...

31:26.011 --> 31:28.180
that firefighters are so cool.

31:29.851 --> 31:30.811
What a slap on the face.

31:31.410 --> 31:32.880
We've been here for half a year,

31:33.281 --> 31:34.620
and we haven't gone home yet.

31:35.321 --> 31:36.021
Look at this.

31:36.650 --> 31:37.720
How can we go home this way?

31:38.091 --> 31:38.890
That's right.

31:39.321 --> 31:40.120
Go home?

31:40.460 --> 31:41.361
Everyone is here.

31:41.420 --> 31:42.361
The Instructor is here.

31:42.491 --> 31:43.390
- Hello, Instructor. - Sit down.

31:43.460 --> 31:44.430
Sit.

31:44.861 --> 31:45.660
Here, Instructor.

31:45.730 --> 31:46.430
Have a seat.

31:48.160 --> 31:48.960
Take your medicines first.

31:49.261 --> 31:49.930
Ge Zheng.

31:50.801 --> 31:51.670
Thank you, Class Monitor.

31:53.071 --> 31:54.341
Dr. Xu said...

31:55.900 --> 31:56.811
you didn't go to change your dressings.

31:57.341 --> 31:58.611
We did it ourselves.

31:59.241 --> 32:00.910
Yes, we did it ourselves.

32:01.111 --> 32:01.841
If you don't treat your wound,

32:01.910 --> 32:02.841
what if it gets infected?

32:03.210 --> 32:04.781
These are minor injuries.

32:04.851 --> 32:05.650
You're...

32:06.620 --> 32:08.521
You're the one who suffered the most.

32:09.720 --> 32:10.491
I'm fine.

32:16.220 --> 32:17.491
Are you feeling down...

32:18.491 --> 32:19.430
due to yesterday's conflict?

32:20.900 --> 32:21.900
No.

32:22.261 --> 32:24.900
- No. - No.

32:25.930 --> 32:26.801
We're good.

32:27.001 --> 32:27.900
You're good?

32:29.741 --> 32:30.440
Yes.

32:31.611 --> 32:32.271
From your faces,

32:32.341 --> 32:33.581
I can see two words.

32:34.440 --> 32:35.281
You're unhappy.

32:44.620 --> 32:46.220
Zhan Da Peng...

32:47.291 --> 32:48.720
is...

32:49.291 --> 32:50.531
quite emotional indeed.

32:51.660 --> 32:52.861
And Yang Chi told me...

32:52.930 --> 32:53.761
that this afternoon,

32:53.831 --> 32:55.261
Gao Yu almost got hurt...

32:55.561 --> 32:56.771
during training.

32:58.271 --> 32:59.101
I went to their dormitory...

32:59.170 --> 33:00.200
to talk to them.

33:00.771 --> 33:01.970
All of them...

33:02.241 --> 33:03.541
seem to be down in the dumps.

33:04.011 --> 33:05.210
If it really doesn't work,

33:06.410 --> 33:08.611
I'll talk to them one-on-one.

33:10.950 --> 33:11.751
What do you think?

33:11.811 --> 33:13.150
Can you give me some advice?

33:15.720 --> 33:16.650
When there's trouble,

33:16.920 --> 33:18.321
he sleeps faster than anyone.

33:23.561 --> 33:24.430
I can't talk to them one-on-one.

33:24.491 --> 33:25.591
If it doesn't go smoothly,

33:25.660 --> 33:26.960
they'll be bent out of shape even more.

33:29.261 --> 33:30.531
I have to think of a way.

33:33.370 --> 33:34.400
You can do this,

33:35.001 --> 33:35.801
Jiang Yu.

33:41.480 --> 33:42.841
You're not sleeping?

33:43.210 --> 33:45.150
I've never seen a man

33:45.210 --> 33:46.880
who talks to himself before.

33:49.081 --> 33:50.251
If you're not sleeping and I'm talking to you,

33:50.321 --> 33:51.591
why didn't you respond?

33:51.791 --> 33:53.091
You answered your own question.

33:53.491 --> 33:54.420
Why should I join the conversation?

33:54.620 --> 33:56.261
Hey, not only are you not helping,

33:56.321 --> 33:58.430
it seems like you're even gloating over my misfortune.

33:58.861 --> 33:59.831
Be more confident.

34:00.630 --> 34:01.801
Remove "it seems like".

34:02.061 --> 34:02.861
Right now,

34:02.930 --> 34:04.430
if there's a knot in their hearts,

34:04.501 --> 34:06.200
we should untie them.

34:06.400 --> 34:08.001
If we don't,

34:08.140 --> 34:09.140
what if something happens...

34:09.200 --> 34:10.071
when they're carrying out missions?

34:10.140 --> 34:11.341
Your nagging...

34:11.940 --> 34:14.210
has really become more and more like an instructor.

34:15.640 --> 34:16.411
You can do it,

34:16.810 --> 34:17.681
Jiang Yu.

34:19.611 --> 34:21.080
You're so gross!

34:30.861 --> 34:32.261
These two pillows are so comfortable.

34:33.130 --> 34:34.960
Shouldn't you throw them back to me?

34:35.431 --> 34:36.801
Lying flat is good for the cervical vertebrae.

34:37.201 --> 34:38.000
Go to sleep.

34:38.301 --> 34:39.371
You can do it, Jiang Yu.

34:45.940 --> 34:47.040
The current time...

34:47.111 --> 34:49.181
is 10:03pm.

34:49.241 --> 34:51.451
It's 29.2 degrees Celsius.

34:53.210 --> 35:00.391
(Serve Yancheng, Very Disciplined, China Fire and Rescue)

35:03.761 --> 35:04.460
Chief.

35:04.531 --> 35:05.330
Instructor.

35:05.431 --> 35:06.460
Class three is assembled.

35:13.670 --> 35:14.341
Zhan Da Peng.

35:15.000 --> 35:15.670
Present.

35:15.741 --> 35:16.871
- Pi Pi. - Present.

35:16.940 --> 35:18.071
- Ge Zheng. - Present.

35:18.141 --> 35:18.940
- Tang Jie. - Present.

35:19.011 --> 35:19.770
Come out.

35:23.411 --> 35:24.210
Get in the car.

35:25.580 --> 35:26.380
- Yes. - Yes.

35:31.650 --> 35:32.621
The rest of you, continue with your training.

35:32.821 --> 35:33.491
- Yes. - Yes.

35:34.891 --> 35:35.560
Let's go.

35:36.491 --> 35:40.031
(Serve Yancheng, Very Disciplined)

35:40.100 --> 35:45.000
(China Fire and Rescue)

35:49.000 --> 35:49.701
Stand properly.

35:51.111 --> 35:51.911
Chief Song.

35:52.210 --> 35:53.580
Please point out...

35:53.781 --> 35:55.611
who obstructed justice and assaulted the police that day.

35:58.611 --> 35:59.580
This is a one-sided mirror, right?

35:59.750 --> 36:00.420
Yes.

36:00.880 --> 36:02.650
It's a form of protection for the witness...

36:02.721 --> 36:04.051
to prevent the suspect from seeing the witness.

36:05.920 --> 36:07.091
We firefighters aren't afraid.

36:07.790 --> 36:08.891
We can see them clearly when we're face to face.

36:27.411 --> 36:28.841
It's so cool to beat firefighters.

36:31.880 --> 36:33.011
When we put on our uniforms...

36:33.880 --> 36:35.020
we save people.

36:35.920 --> 36:36.850
We won't fight back.

36:37.290 --> 36:38.451
We won't bully you either.

36:41.420 --> 36:42.891
But when I take off my uniform,

36:44.130 --> 36:45.661
I'll take you down in no time.

36:49.100 --> 36:49.801
Come on.

36:50.201 --> 36:51.000
Point them out.

36:51.170 --> 36:51.830
- Yes. - Yes.

36:51.900 --> 36:52.571
It's them.

36:52.670 --> 36:53.871
You did this, remember?

36:55.141 --> 36:55.841
Officer Wang.

36:56.371 --> 36:57.741
They obstructed the firefighters...

36:58.111 --> 36:59.141
and even beat them up.

36:59.710 --> 37:00.710
Is that against the law?

37:00.781 --> 37:01.580
Of course.

37:02.411 --> 37:03.310
Using violence...

37:03.380 --> 37:04.350
and threats...

37:04.411 --> 37:05.880
to obstruct the staff of state organs...

37:05.951 --> 37:07.181
in carrying out their duties in accordance with the law,

37:07.451 --> 37:08.980
they'll be charged with obstruction of justice...

37:09.250 --> 37:10.951
and imprisoned to no more than three years,

37:11.020 --> 37:13.491
detention, confinement, or fine.

37:14.060 --> 37:15.121
Is that clear?

37:15.290 --> 37:15.960
No way.

37:16.020 --> 37:17.761
Is beating up firefighters that serious?

37:18.261 --> 37:19.931
So behave yourselves, all of you.

37:23.500 --> 37:24.330
Buddy.

37:25.301 --> 37:26.400
- Boss. - Sir.

37:26.471 --> 37:27.540
- I won't do it again. - Let go.

37:27.600 --> 37:28.971
- How about... - I can't spend three years inside.

37:29.040 --> 37:30.971
Great people don't harbor grievances for past mistakes.

37:31.341 --> 37:32.710
Or hit me twice.

37:32.841 --> 37:34.011
I didn't hit you.

37:34.241 --> 37:35.611
I promise it won't happen again.

37:35.810 --> 37:37.080
- I promise. - Let go.

37:37.480 --> 37:38.650
I was wrong.

37:39.051 --> 37:39.781
If I hadn't held back,

37:39.850 --> 37:41.150
I would've knocked you out.

37:41.350 --> 37:42.451
You hit a firefighter.

37:42.920 --> 37:45.020
Come on. I'll kneel in front of you, sir.

37:49.920 --> 37:50.891
Quick!

37:52.261 --> 37:53.230
Faster.

37:55.600 --> 37:56.460
Sprint!

38:11.880 --> 38:12.951
Nice, Pi Pi.

38:13.011 --> 38:14.181
You were faster then Ge Zheng.

38:14.781 --> 38:16.051
Didn't you say that you don't even have the energy to play games?

38:16.451 --> 38:17.650
I'm full of energy now.

38:18.020 --> 38:19.190
It's not just Ge Zheng.

38:19.821 --> 38:20.621
I can...

38:21.491 --> 38:23.221
even challenge you.

38:23.290 --> 38:24.330
Just bluff here.

38:24.960 --> 38:25.761
Let me tell you.

38:26.431 --> 38:27.630
If it weren't for my leg injury,

38:28.100 --> 38:29.761
you can't even outrun me.

38:30.330 --> 38:31.330
He's pretty awesome now.

38:31.670 --> 38:32.471
I'm not awesome.

38:32.871 --> 38:33.600
I think Chief...

38:33.670 --> 38:34.400
is the real awesome one.

38:34.670 --> 38:36.641
When those ferocious and cruel dudes...

38:36.701 --> 38:37.641
saw our chief,

38:37.911 --> 38:39.071
they were all like cowards.

38:39.141 --> 38:40.111
They wanted to kneel down.

38:40.380 --> 38:41.440
It was so satisfying.

38:41.511 --> 38:42.480
Our chief...

38:42.810 --> 38:44.411
is so cool and domineering.

38:44.480 --> 38:45.281
Cool?

38:45.880 --> 38:47.051
You all did well this time.

38:47.380 --> 38:48.451
You've improved.

38:48.781 --> 38:49.821
Let me tell you.

38:50.451 --> 38:52.391
Don't compare those thugs to our chief.

38:53.091 --> 38:54.261
He's not a fierce person.

38:54.991 --> 38:57.091
You should see his other qualities.

38:57.661 --> 38:58.690
He's resilient.

38:58.761 --> 38:59.730
He cherishes his team members.

38:59.861 --> 39:01.531
He's an exemplary model. He's good at everything.

39:01.701 --> 39:02.600
Learn from him.

39:02.730 --> 39:03.900
- Okay. - Yes.

39:03.971 --> 39:04.630
Class Monitor.

39:05.000 --> 39:07.270
When can I become like our chief?

39:07.400 --> 39:08.540
I think you stand a chance.

39:08.600 --> 39:10.000
I guess...

39:10.241 --> 39:11.411
you'll have to be reincarnated.

39:11.540 --> 39:12.241
You...

39:12.810 --> 39:13.511
What?

39:14.940 --> 39:15.681
Are you not convinced?

39:15.940 --> 39:17.611
You just ran 5,000 km.

39:17.951 --> 39:18.710
Let's do another round.

39:18.781 --> 39:19.781
I'm not afraid of you.

39:19.880 --> 39:21.080
Class Monitor, more training.

39:21.951 --> 39:23.020
Not bad.

39:23.920 --> 39:24.850
Are you confident?

39:25.020 --> 39:25.690
Yes.

39:25.750 --> 39:26.420
Get ready.

39:28.821 --> 39:33.931
- You can do it! - Go!
